    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are people to talk to but it doesnt actually change anything. the world is still the same tomorrow. i'm just so exhausted by the performance of it all. like i'm constantly pretending just to exist, and it feels like a debt i can't ever pay off. i'm just done with the struggle.",
